<title>CANADA: Canada dlr firms from 2-year lows hit overnight.</title>
<headline>Canada dlr firms from 2-year lows hit overnight.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3980/1.4040	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3964</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3740   SUPPORT 1.3440	HI 1.4019   LO  1.3965</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3992/97    HI 1.4019     EUROPE OPEN     1.3994</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3974/79    LO 1.3965     HI 1.3972   LO  1.3962</p>
<p>----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------- * Canada's dollar firmed to C$1.3972 (US$0.7157) at midday on</p>
<p>Thursday from overnight lows around C$1.4018 (US$0.7133), its</p>
<p>weakest level in two years.</p>
<p>* Traders said the currency recovered on the continuing</p>
<p>momentum begun when the Bank of England intervened to support</p>
<p>the Canadian dollar overnight, dealers said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
